#13 13.63 Much effort has been expended to ensure that this shell script will run on any
#13 13.63 Unix system.  If despite that it blows up on yours, your best bet is to edit
#13 13.63 Configure and run it again.  If you can't run Configure for some reason,
#13 13.63 you'll have to generate a config.sh file by hand.  Whatever problems you
#13 13.63 have, let me (https://github.com/Perl/perl5/issues) know how I blew it.
